<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Orion Electric H1 net drops.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Orion Electric H1 net drops.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				     328 vs 655</p>
<p>    Net					    5.11 vs 10.28</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			  6.56 vs 12.57</p>
<p>    Turnover				   412.76 vs 384.35</p>
<p>Note - Orion Electric Co Ltd, a unit of Daewoo Group, is one of South Korea's leading TV tube makers. The figures were provided by the Korea Listed Companies Association. -- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5645</p>
